+        <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
+        <p>Welcome to <strong>FinalTube AI</strong>. We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting the personal data and channel credentials you entrust to us. This Privacy Policy explains how FinalTube AI collects, uses, stores, and protects your information when you connect your YouTube channel and use our automated growth intelligence and video production platform.</p>
+        <p>By connecting your YouTube channel or accessing FinalTube AI, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this Privacy Policy.</p>
