+
+      <section class="legal-section">
+        <h2>2. YouTube OAuth Integration & Permissions</h2>
+        <p>FinalTube AI integrates with Google OAuth 2.0 services to interact with your YouTube channel. When you click "Connect with YouTube", you grant FinalTube AI explicit permission to access specific YouTube scopes necessary for automated channel management:</p>
+        
+        <ul>
+          <li>
+            <div class="scope-badge">https://www.googleapis.com/auth/youtube.upload</div>
+            <div><strong>YouTube Direct Upload Permission:</strong> Allows FinalTube AI to upload completed 1080p MP4 videos, set custom thumbnails, titles, descriptions, tags, and publishing visibility status (Public, Private, or Unlisted) based on your configured channel preferences.</div>
+          </li>
+          <li>
+            <div class="scope-badge">https://www.googleapis.com/auth/youtube.readonly</div>
