+
+        <p>FinalTube AI complies strictly with the <a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google API Services User Data Policy</a>, including the Limited Use requirements. We do NOT request permissions beyond what is required to generate, publish, and analyze your channel's content.</p>
