+        </ul>
+        <p><strong>Data Privacy in AI Processing:</strong> Prompt text and visual topic prompts sent to Gemini and Cloudflare AI contain non-personal, topic-focused creative content (e.g. "What if Earth stops rotating?"). No personal user data or OAuth credentials are ever shared with or submitted to AI model providers for training purposes.</p>
